{"seq":17,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/si-04-quarrendon-main-contact/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:06:13.698Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"07a93a43a3bf6f474811a4175b559c1be4c1fb63c72d3473ff149cb8534a4c38","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#north-team","text":"@Ilse Varga The contact for that is Thea Ramaswell, Director of Yard Operations at Quarrendon Freight Lines. She's their main contact. On 20 Aug 2025 here in #north-team, Dana said Thea had flagged the door 6 duplicate arrivals again on the morning shift. In that case the same trailer showed up as two 06:30 check-ins because the driver checked in at the kiosk and then dispatch added him by hand. Dana owns the account day to day.","thread_ts":"1791987000.000128"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791987000.000129","thread_ts":"1791987000.000128"}}
{"seq":18,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/si-04-quarrendon-main-contact/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:06:18.557Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"83af973ff9c5b31995db6574408d3c38606216c10dbdfc9e20445c7b47cdf1d4","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","text":"I've answered Ilse in a thread reply on her #north-team message. The contact is **Thea Ramaswell**, Director of Yard Operations at Quarrendon Freight Lines, and she's their main contact.\n\n- **Where this comes from:** On 20 Aug 2025 in #north-team, Dana Okafor said Thea had flagged the door 6 duplicate arrivals again on the morning shift. The same trailer showed up as two 06:30 check-ins: the driver checked in at the kiosk, then dispatch added him by hand. Ilse was in that conversation too.\n- **\"Main contact\" title:** That comes from the North team cheat sheet, a public file.\n- **Account owner:** My reply also says Dana owns the account day to day. That rests on brain notes calling it \"Dana's freight account\"; I didn't find a CRM record saying so.\n\nI couldn't see any files in the Quarrendon account folders, so I didn't check a CRM contact record. I also didn't confirm Thea is still the contact today: the door 6 report and the cheat sheet are from 2025. The latest note I found is from March 2026, when she co-signed the renewal. I left the seat counts from that same conversation out of the reply because Ilse didn't ask for them."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791987000.000130"}}
